Projects.Highlights:
No treatment;

Reasons not to seed - adequate residual seed supply within grassy burn watersheds, fire was of moderate burn intensity, size of burn acreage was too small to justify aerial seeding contracting and still be economical.

No downstream structures at risk to call for channel treatments.

